  "title": "Wipro Selected as Dow Jones Sustainability World Index (DJSI) Member for the 11th Consecutive Year",
  "summary": "Wipro Limited (NYSE: WIT, BSE: 507685, NSE: WIPRO), a leading global information technology, consulting and business process services company, today announced that it has been selected as a member of the global Dow Jones Sustainability World Index (DJSI) – 2020 for the eleventh year in succession.",
